++++# API Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-85 (KB-P3-05)
++++
++++- Auditor: arch-reviewer (Swarm Systems/Backend Architect & API Specialist Gate)
++++- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-85`
