+++   - **Unit Tests**: 14/14 tests passing in 4.42s with **97.67%** branch + line coverage (`kanban.api.v1.links` 100%, `kanban.services.object_ref` 100%, `kanban.services.links` 97%), exceeding the 95% threshold.
