++
++### 5. Gate Sign-Off
++I have completed the UI and UX Architecture Specialist Gate audit for `KANBA-92`. All layout, token, accessibility, responsive, non-blocking, and optimistic mutation criteria are fully met.
++
++Verdict: APPROVED
